'''Iron Claw X''' (剛拳にゃんこG Tsuyoshi Ken Nyanko G, '''Goken Cat G''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Kung-Fu X Awakens!]]. He was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Iron Claw X
|image = E 265.png
|appearance = [[Kung-Fu X Awakens!]]
|money drop = 2,200¢ - 8,690¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has massive health and attack power, a fast attack rate, long range, and has a 100% chance to knockback whatever that survives these attacks. He isn't too threatening due to single target, but can still be annoying in groups.

==Encounters==
{{Collapsible}}
This enemy has always appeared at 100% strength magnification.
